silm:instances_papers_21_ologs_and_typed_english_chapters_08_cross_paper_bridges_sections_04_bridge_to_18_presheaf_semantics_concrete_anchor_3_Yoneda_embedding#yonedaembedding silm:hasLongDescription "The YonedaEmbedding is the embedding O_eng -> Set^{O_eng^op}. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'Yoneda_embedding', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
